      button .Bthro | Through |  at x1     ymax+0.2        call |Call !!MdsPosThro(!!MdsFt45)|
      option .Select             at xmax+1 ymin            call |Call !!MdsThroSelect(!!MdsFt45)| width 13
      para   .P                  at x1     ymax+0.2 width 25 lines 1

    exit

    -- Creation
