      button .CreateByCur at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Cursor' pixmap width 19 height 19 call |Call !!MdsCreateFt45('CURSOR')|
      button .CreateByDim at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Dimensions' pixmap width 19 height 19 call |Call !!MdsCreateFt45('DIMENSION')|
      button .CreateByCle at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Clearance' pixmap width 19 height 19 call |Call !!MdsCreateFt45('CLEARANCE')|
