      button .AddRack  at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Add Rack'       pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsAddRack(!!MdsFt45)|
      button .AddBar   at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Add Cross Bar'  pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsAddBarFt45(_Support, 'NEW')|
      button .Flip     at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Mirror Frame'   pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsMirrorFt45()|
      button .Hand     at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Rotate Frame'   pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsRotateFrame(!!MdsFt45)|
      button .AlignSup at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Align Support'  pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!Mdsxalign(!!Mdsft45)|
      button .ModSctn  at xmax+0.1 ymin tooltip 'Modify Section' pixmap width 18 height 18 call |Call !!MdsPosse(!!MdsFT45)|


-- Icons Row 2

